1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,700
I have, at this point, a four-person company.

2
00:00:03,700 --> 00:00:05,280
That's all I need.

3
00:00:05,280 --> 00:00:10,060
But with AI, I have 1,000 four-person companies.

4
00:00:10,060 --> 00:00:11,520
These things are now autonomous.

5
00:00:11,520 --> 00:00:16,020
By next year, I'll have 10,000—

6
00:00:16,020 --> 00:00:21,900
10,000 four-person companies that can help me
and support my clients.

7
00:00:21,900 --> 00:00:26,660
In November 2022, ChatGPT came out.

8
00:00:26,660 --> 00:00:30,740
And I took a two-week vacation, and I sat on my couch

9
00:00:30,740 --> 00:00:33,340
with my phone, with my computer,

10
00:00:33,340 --> 00:00:35,460
and I just played for two weeks.

11
00:00:35,460 --> 00:00:38,580
And I was like, this—this is now the time.

12
00:00:38,580 --> 00:00:41,260
Having loved technology and been part of that story
my whole life, I knew this was the time.

13
00:00:41,260 --> 00:00:49,580
On most things that we do on a computer,
the AI is right more than humans.

14
00:00:49,580 --> 00:00:54,820
Does it still make mistakes? Sure.
Are you going to give up your sovereignty to the AI,

15
00:00:54,820 --> 00:01:00,300
or do you want to use it as a tool?
Do you want it to teach you to be smarter and better,

16
00:01:00,300 --> 00:01:03,233
or do all of your thinking for you?
